# CourtPass (Mahgooz)

Padel court booking: Pay → Reserve → Redeem. Two courts in Sheikh Zayed, Egypt.

## Before coding

1. Read `docs/pages-and-ui-design.md` for pages, UI spec, and MVP build order
2. For Paymob work, use the project skill at `.cursor/skills/paymob-integration/SKILL.md`
3. For Django MCP tools, use `.cursor/skills/django-mcp-server/SKILL.md` (fetch live README)

## Stack

Django + DRF + React + TypeScript + shadcn/ui. Auth via phone + password. MCP via django-mcp-server.

## Rules

- Mobile-first (390px), min 44×44px touch targets
- Slot hold TTL: 10 min; webhook confirms payment, not redirect
- Egyptian mobile format: `01xxxxxxxxx`
- Keep scope tight — see AGENTS.md scope guard
